                     </biblList>
                  </event>
                  <event xml:id="event_d1e815796">
                     <persName role="" xml:id="persName_8c5a4e3a">Anton Svendsen, violin</persName>
                     <persName role="" xml:id="persName_0dc518fc">G.A. Lembcke, piano</persName>
                     <date isodate="1869-12-18" xml:id="date_33ddc3ee">1869-12-18</date>
                     <geogName role="venue" xml:id="geogName_497ce3e4">Kammermusikforeningen</geogName>
                     <geogName role="place" xml:id="geogName_6f30f9fe">Copenhagen</geogName>
                     <desc xml:id="desc_e19d36a2"/>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm140">According to the printed 1887 edition, the sonata was written in 1840;  the correspondence between Hartmann and his publisher, Julius Schuberth, suggests, however, that it was written in 1844. Also in a letter to his wife dated 22 October 1844, Hartmann calls it "my new sonata".</p>
            </history>
